Provenance

The benchmark tasks, dbt models, verifiers, and the `retail` dataset
(retail.duckdb) in this repository are original works authored by Snowflake for
the data-eng-bench benchmark. The dataset is a synthetic retail data warehouse
(orders, customers, products, SAP-style source tables); it contains no real
customer data and no third-party proprietary data.

The repository layout, the `leaderboard/` tooling, and the
`.github/workflows/leaderboard-*.yml` workflows are adapted from the
Harbor Terminal-Bench 2.1 reference repository
(https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2-1), also Apache-2.0.

Third-party components

The base Docker image installs the following at build time from their public
distribution channels (none are vendored/redistributed in this repository):

  - dbt-core, dbt-duckdb, dbt-snowflake  (Apache-2.0)   via PyPI
  - duckdb                                (MIT)          via PyPI
  - pytest, pandas, numpy                 (various OSS)  via PyPI
  - dbt-labs/dbt_utils                    (Apache-2.0)   via dbt Hub (packages.yml)
  - python:3.12-slim base image                          via Docker Hub
  - Node.js 22                            (MIT)          via NodeSource

Each retains its own license.
